mber","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-08T20:37:15-07:00","id":1395224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Irusan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1395186-books-needed-for-aberrant?p=1395192#post1395192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thanks! Just looked up if there was a Kickstarter and looks like Backerkits are still available.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed, and soon (not sure when) it will be available to backers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T00:52:03-07:00","id":1395264,"title":"","content":"Yep, as indicated, you'll only need two books:<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/260788/Trinity-Continuum-Core-Rulebook\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum core rules</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://trinity-continuum-aberrant.backerkit.com/hosted_preorders\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum: Aberrant</a></li> </ul>The former contains the core Storypath rules, plus a modern-day action-adventure setting, and rules for Talents -- people with an extraordinary degree of skill and luck. Your standard action movie character, basically.<br /> <br /> The latter is the new edition of the Aberrant RPG, which builds on those core rules, set in 2028. Stuff which didn't appear until later in the line originally is now in the core: groups like Teen Tomorrow or the Daedalus League. And there's new material too, like Team Tonight.<br /> <br /> The two-book approach means that you can use Talents in your Aberrant game if you want -- so if you're doing the Avengers, you can represent characters like Black Widow and Hawkeye as Talents.<br /> <br /> Aberrant also has suggestions for updating some of the Talent-focused Allegiances from the core into Aberrant, so you have additional character options. We wanted to give you more bang for your buck.<br /> <br /> If you'd like to get an early start, the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/287022/You-Are-Not-Alone--Trinity-Continuum-Aberrant-Comic\" target=\"_blank\">You Are Not Alone comic</a> introducing the setting, featuring Antaeus, is currently available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T17:11:20-07:00","id":1395482,"title":"","content":"I really like the being able to incorporate skilled &quot;regular&quot; characters to go along with the more super-powered characters. I'll be sure to check out the comic as well, the metaplot and narrative surrounding Aberrant were always great. The mixing of believable media reactions to something like Novas appearing always made the setting feel really compelling and alive for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26138-irusan","name":"Irusan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}